WEBVTT

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.351
But you know, this is a stunning example,

00:05:32.375 --> 00:05:34.601
and it's worthy of reflection.

00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:40.684
Here, human beings spend an enormous
amount of energy and imagination

00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:42.934
knowing that the city is going to reverse,

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:44.601
it's going to be disassembled,

00:05:44.625 --> 00:05:46.809
it's going to disappear,

00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:49.208
it's the ephemeral megacity.

00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:52.976
And it has profound lessons to teach us.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.851
Lessons about how to touch
the ground lightly,

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:58.351
about reversibility,

00:05:58.375 --> 00:05:59.875
about disassembly.